  "description": "SPARTA C-GRID ENERGY – STYLISH IN THE CITY\n\nThe SPARTA c-GRID ENERGY is an agile city bike with a sporty and youthful character, designed for those who want to combine style and comfort in everyday city traffic.\nThe bike is equipped with a Bosch Active Line Plus motor and the BES3 system, with a 500Wh battery neatly integrated into the frame. The Bosch Purion 200 display provides clarity and control during every ride. Thanks to the handlebar-mounted headlight, the c-GRID ENERGY is fully urban-ready.\n\nThe retail price of this e-bike includes VAT and excludes a €4.50 battery recycling fee in the Netherlands. Please note: specifications may vary. Consult the product details for the exact specifications or contact your dealer.",
